  {
   "id": "kovox-pitch-133139@1.1.0",
   "gameId": "kovox-pitch-133139",
   "displayName": "Update 1.1.0",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-04-14T15:14:48.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello everyone!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Huge update is here. Let's do a quick overview of it!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Colors",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Every piece of interface now consists of one or more of 4 main colors - pink, yellow, black and white.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Shapes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Clickable items have almost-parallelogram shape. Other non-interactable pieces, like backgrounds or additional graphics, have similar shape. But some of them are different, like this lighting-shaped Settings menu.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Animations",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "When you open another part of the main or gameplay menu, it will have a short transition animation.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "New Languages",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "I've added 3 new languages to the game - Japanese, Korean and Traditional Chinese. Every game looks immediately cooler when it has Asian languages!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "P.S.",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "There is still a lot of work to do to make this game much better. Bug fixes, balance, VFXs.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Since the last year I started working in a gamedev company, so I don't have much time to work on Kovox Pitch and Lofi Ping Pong. But every time I have a free evening, I sit down to work on my games.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "My next goal is to make a balance patch - the thing that I never considered important in my games, but now I do.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
